  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Neku is a decentralized multi-chain lending protocol that enables users to supply and borrow crypto assets through a Compound-based architecture. The listed contracts represent the Arbitrum deployment subset, including a Unitroller/Comptroller control plane and CErc20Delegator market contracts. Governance or incentive-token claims should be treated as unverified unless supported by contract, documentation, or audit evidence.",
